{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_032_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b51c56af26c9df803261fc39aeb7c1646a5d64b1c9cb88ca6f58beedf2443b2b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f893c1abcc1f4bc66ae839d9abba2460483b0170f039c43cc6d99c59140fcd2",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，方便占用一点时间吗？\n我把情人节的回礼带来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3ed0c0debc7a4bd5024a97b35babb69a0ba7fdaca2ce1ec6f65def15eca5739",
      "text": "白色情人节快乐。\n这个……请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d89a79776336c30aa236bbf1f7da75b440e19de5efb220739c885f10464688df",
      "text": "收到情人节巧克力，我真的很开心。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8551bfadfa9ac73acaa2607ea3cc2af0a04350510579bbf70a2bc53426a46be3",
      "text": "我是想着要是能让你也像那时的我一样开心就好了，\n一边这样想着一边挑选的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae5163ac6120d28f090c3f2b649dacf97974bbdf157bc184a4166809909a9a41",
      "text": "里面的东西要是也能合你心意的话，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5f931c0cdff59b925dc260b6e07ef1124c948cd520da25e1fdf3c755a5508b5",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。我想稍微跟您说几句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a782339432a9d84511503b47fd25b00ef77998d87246104e4142f3883ebb3b0f",
      "text": "请收下这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf83ca6cb028dbbc8ff981ed5594ce998c6eb9c5df35258f1f475db79908005",
      "text": "情人节的时候，\n非常感谢您的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bdb181f2aed99de56a7c09a452ff89cdeb53ba389b2de35d17e421fada5d4c9",
      "text": "吃下制作人送给我的巧克力，\n就感觉浑身涌起了力量，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:051628092225520c300258bec853981cf4083ef7714a767c611af6f9a2d122f8",
      "text": "在初次前往现场时，或者感到紧张的拍摄日，\n我都会一点一点地吃上一块。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fd9854bfe1f6557b7e6324a11759401daf05fab521bc5ce1bea65f5b620802f",
      "text": "多亏了那盒巧克力，在各种各样的工作中，\n我都取得了超出预期的好成果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7323718d83a517c568aa5daa9f74afbf3a729ba99760f3e2444499890ae8755f",
      "text": "巧克力能派上用场真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a138c02d0bb6a31bd3b4ccc2e9c436ce499e8f431d4c706592755cba344a3c",
      "text": "最近的工作表现非常精彩哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ea0a380f69b99f68714717be62a1677feb8bdc225bc3904d539eeb8a15aa85",
      "text": "嗯。虽然巧克力已经吃完了，\n但我今后也会继续加油的，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c42a22e285ce248c4ddeb9b51a3568eb53de5dbb4fbabf31bdc7fad711132a2",
      "text": "非常感谢。虽然巧克力已经吃完了，\n但我今后也会继续加油的，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_032_22:5_02_032_22_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ec5ad0d1515d1ca54d1eb27477b8f89d658b8bb7da223ca33b56d2ee2d06036",
      "text": "……啊！明明本来只打算聊一会儿的，\n不知不觉说了好多呢。那么，我先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
